#### [MODIFY] [ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/src/ScrollBenchImageModel.cpp)

**Implement methods:**
- `toggleSelection()` - Toggle selection state, emit dataChanged
- `selectAll()` - Set all items selected
- `clearSelection()` - Clear all selections
- `deleteSelected()` - Remove selected items from model
- `selectedCount()` - Count selected items

**Update roleNames():**
- Add `IsSelectedRole = "isSelected"`

