### MainScrollBench.qml

#### [MODIFY] [MainScrollBench.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/test_scrollbench/qml/MainScrollBench.qml)

**Add to delegate:**
```qml
// Checkbox (top-left corner)
Rectangle {
    width: Math.max(16, Math.min(32, gridView.cellWidth / 8))
    height: width
    anchors.top: parent.top
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.margins: 2
    color: model.isSelected ? "#2196F3" : "#80000000"
    border.color: "#FFFFFF"
    border.width: 1
    radius: 2
    z: 10
    
    Text {
        anchors.centerIn: parent
        text: "✓"
        color: "#FFFFFF"
        visible: model.isSelected
        font.pixelSize: parent.width * 0.6
    }
    
    MouseArea {
        anchors.fill: parent
        anchors.margins: -5  // Larger hit area
        onClicked: {
            imageModel.toggleSelection(model.imageIndex)
            mouse.accepted = true
        }
    }
}
```

**Add SelectionBar:**
```qml
// Selection Bar (bottom)
Rectangle {
    anchors.bottom: parent.bottom
    anchors.left: parent.left
    anchors.right: parent.right
    height: 60
    color: "#2196F3"
    visible: imageModel.selectedCount > 0
    z: 200
    
    RowLayout {
        anchors.fill: parent
        anchors.margins: 10
        
        Text {
            text: imageModel.selectedCount + " selected"
            color: "#FFFFFF"
            font.pixelSize: 16
        }
        
        Item { Layout.fillWidth: true }
        
        Button {
            text: "Delete"
            onClicked: imageModel.deleteSelected()
        }
        
        Button {
            text: "Deselect All"
            onClicked: imageModel.clearSelection()
        }
    }
}
```

