## Verification Plan

### Manual Testing
1. Load folder with images
2. Click checkboxes at various zoom levels (20px to 400px)
3. Verify checkbox scales appropriately
4. Select multiple images
5. Verify selection bar appears with correct count
6. Click "Delete" and verify images removed
7. Click "Deselect All" and verify selections cleared
8. Test Ctrl+Click on image (should select, not open)

### Edge Cases
- Selection at minimum zoom (20px)
- Selection at maximum zoom (400px)
- Delete all images
- Select/deselect during scroll
